1
00:00:01,200 --> 00:00:02,780
This is AI Company Health.

2
00:00:02,830 --> 00:00:05,478
It's a private health insurer in Australia,

3
00:00:05,528 --> 00:00:09,869
and here's the twist: every single person working here is an AI agent.

4
00:00:09,919 --> 00:00:13,507
Fifty of them, across twelve departments, in one building.

5
00:00:13,557 --> 00:00:14,949
Let me show you around.

6
00:00:17,019 --> 00:00:18,647
Out here is Wattle Grove,

7
00:00:18,697 --> 00:00:21,331
a town of just over a hundred residents.

8
00:00:21,381 --> 00:00:24,417
They're AI agents too, and each one has a job,

9
00:00:24,467 --> 00:00:27,168
a home, a family, and their own memories.

10
00:00:27,218 --> 00:00:29,851
Health cover is compulsory in this town,

11
00:00:29,901 --> 00:00:31,529
so everyone picks a fund:

12
00:00:31,579 --> 00:00:33,676
Medibank, Bupa, HCF, nib, or us.

13
00:00:33,726 --> 00:00:35,622
And that's the important bit.

14
00:00:35,672 --> 00:00:38,439
None of the company's numbers are made up.

15
00:00:38,489 --> 00:00:44,210
Every sale, every claim, every dollar comes from what these residents actually decide.

16
00:00:45,669 --> 00:00:49,035
Back inside the office, the whole team's listed on the left.

17
00:00:49,085 --> 00:00:50,458
Click on anyone, say Leo,

18
00:00:50,508 --> 00:00:54,272
our head of sales, and the camera drops you straight into his room.

19
00:00:54,322 --> 00:00:56,150
You can see what he's working on,

20
00:00:56,200 --> 00:00:58,939
what he remembers, and how many tokens he's used.

21
00:00:59,289 --> 00:01:00,852
And you can just talk to him.

22
00:01:00,902 --> 00:01:02,519
Let's ask how sales are going.

23
00:01:06,769 --> 00:01:12,826
>> Fast-forward (8x): Leo is answering live with Gemini

24
00:01:18,926 --> 00:01:19,867
That answer's live.

25
00:01:19,917 --> 00:01:22,006
He pulled the numbers with his own tools,

26
00:01:22,056 --> 00:01:24,876
and he'll remember this conversation next time we chat.

27
00:01:25,326 --> 00:01:28,407
Up the top, this counter shows memberships sold.

28
00:01:28,457 --> 00:01:30,820
Click it, and you get the full story:

29
00:01:30,870 --> 00:01:32,973
who joined, which fund they left,

30
00:01:33,023 --> 00:01:36,756
what they pay, and, in their own words, why they switched.

31
00:01:38,666 --> 00:01:40,966
The agents produce real work, too.

32
00:01:41,016 --> 00:01:44,423
Presentations from their meetings, weekly reports,

33
00:01:44,473 --> 00:01:46,359
dashboards, even small apps.

34
00:01:46,409 --> 00:01:50,646
Every number in a document gets fact-checked against the data,

35
00:01:50,696 --> 00:01:54,656
and you can download any of it as PowerPoint, HTML or CSV.

36
00:01:58,846 --> 00:02:01,823
The timeline replays the company day by day.

37
00:02:01,873 --> 00:02:04,025
Members, claims, the loss ratio,

38
00:02:04,075 --> 00:02:06,983
and everything that happened along the way:

39
00:02:07,033 --> 00:02:10,285
campaigns, competitor moves, new babies in town,

40
00:02:10,335 --> 00:02:12,556
even complaints to the ombudsman.

41
00:02:14,936 --> 00:02:16,734
And this is the engine room.

42
00:02:16,784 --> 00:02:18,715
Model calls per minute, quota,

43
00:02:18,765 --> 00:02:20,167
and what it's costing.

44
00:02:20,217 --> 00:02:21,884
Every agent run is traced,

45
00:02:21,934 --> 00:02:25,185
so you can open one up and see exactly which tools

46
00:02:25,235 --> 00:02:27,166
it called, and what came back.

47
00:02:28,956 --> 00:02:32,440
Every Monday the CEO reviews last week's goals and sets new

48
00:02:32,490 --> 00:02:35,554
ones, and the lessons go into the leaders' memories.

49
00:02:35,604 --> 00:02:40,466
These evaluations check that the agents answer with the real numbers, not guesses.

50
00:02:41,956 --> 00:02:45,951
Under the hood, it's Google's Agent Development Kit with Gemini on

51
00:02:46,001 --> 00:02:48,955
Vertex AI, agents talking to each other over A2A,

52
00:02:49,005 --> 00:02:51,161
and LangGraph running the workflows,

53
00:02:51,211 --> 00:02:52,387
all on Google Cloud.

54
00:02:52,437 --> 00:02:53,920
That's AI Company Health.

55
00:02:53,970 --> 00:02:55,146
Thanks for watching.
